# SPA fallback for Netlify and Cloudflare Pages.
#
# The build emits a single index.html, so a direct request for a client-side
# route -- /privacy and /terms in particular -- would otherwise 404. Those two
# URLs are submitted to App Store Connect and the Play Console and are fetched
# directly, so this rule is load-bearing, not a nicety.
#
# Real files win over this rule, so hashed assets under /assets/* are unaffected.
/*    /index.html   200
